     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear shiny users :)<br><br>I am trying to implement an app that use an object as a reactive value. <br>When attributes inside the object are changed, the UI should be notified and redraw. <br>This does not work. It seems that if I make a class object reactive, it does not notice changes on the attributes.<br>Is this true? If so, how can I make the reactive object react to changes in the attributes. In the following I have created a small example that illustrates my issue<br><br>Thanks a lot for your help :)<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">interactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  counter </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> R6Class</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">public</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>         increase </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           </span><span style=\"color:#008\">self</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">self</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>         </span><span style=\"color:#660\">},</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>         decrease </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           </span><span style=\"color:#008\">self</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">self</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>         </span><span style=\"color:#660\">},</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>         getValue </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">self</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>         </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;minus&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;-1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;plus&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;+1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    br</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    textOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;value&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># The comments below show the equivalent logic using reactiveValues()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    c </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactiveVal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>      <br>    c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">counter$new</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$minus</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$decrease</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$plus</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$increase</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    output$value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderText</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$getValue</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>      </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># print(c()$value)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><br><br></div>"
