    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  count &lt;- counter$new(shiny = TRUE)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  </font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  observeEvent(input$minus, { count$setDecrement() })</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  observeEvent(input$plus,  { count$setIncrement() })</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  </font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  output$value &lt;- renderText({ count$getValue() })</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">}</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">shinyApp(ui, server)</font></div></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br><div><br>On Tuesday, August 1, 2017 at 10:00:07 PM UTC+1, Bárbara Borges wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Great question! The problem here is that Shiny has no way of knowing the object has changed. The best way to solve this is by introducing reactivity into the object class itself. This isn&#39;t at all obvious and what I&#39;d recommend involves using a custom function that will likely make it to Shiny (or a related utilities packages). For now, though you just have to define it yourself:<div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div>reactiveTrigger &lt;- function() {</div><div>  rv &lt;- reactiveValues(a = 0)</div><div>  list(</div><div>    depend = function() {</div><div>      rv$a</div><div>      invisible()</div><div>    },</div><div>    trigger = function() {</div><div>      rv$a &lt;- isolate(rv$a + 1)</div><div>    }</div><div>  )</div><div>}</div></div></code></div><br><br></div><div>Let&#39;s unpack this. This construct allows you to create a reactive trigger that &quot;knows&quot; (though you have to tell it) when your object has changed (i.e. when it should &quot;fire&quot;/trigger) and when it should be aware of these changes (i.e. when you want it to update if somewhere else it fires). You can think of this construct as &quot;baking reactivity&quot; into your object. In order to keep your object usable outside of Shiny (if that&#39;s what you want), you can do a conditional based on a user-supplied parameter.</div><div><br></div><div>I adapted your example to use this (and still be generic enough):</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div><font color=\"#660066\">library(shiny)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">reactiveTrigger &lt;- function() {</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  rv &lt;- reactiveValues(a = 0)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  list(</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">    depend = function() {</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">      rv$a</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">      invisible()</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">    },</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">    trigger = function() {</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">      rv$a &lt;- isolate(rv$a + 1)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">    }</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  )</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">}</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">counter &lt;- R6::R6Class(</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  public = list(</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">    initialize = function(shiny = FALSE) {</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">      private$shiny = shiny</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">      private$value = 0</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">      private$rxTrigger = reactiveTrigger()</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">    },</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">    setIncrement = function() {</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">      if (private$shiny) private$rxTrigger$trigger()</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">      private$value = private$value + 1</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">    },</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">    setDecrement = function() {</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">      if (private$shiny) private$rxTrigger$trigger()</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">      private$value = private$value -1</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">    },</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">    getValue = function() {</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">      if (private$shiny) private$rxTrigger$depend()</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">      return(private$value)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">    }</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  ),</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  private = list(</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">    shiny = NULL,</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">    value = NULL,</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">    rxTrigger = NULL</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  )</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">ui &lt;- fluidPage(</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  actionButton(&quot;minus&quot;, &quot;-1&quot;),</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  actionButton(&quot;plus&quot;, &quot;+1&quot;),</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  textOutput(&quot;value&quot;)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">)</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">server &lt;- function(input, output, session) {</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  count &lt;- reactiveVal(counter$new(shiny = TRUE))</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  </font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  observeEvent(input$minus, { count()$setDecrement() })</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  observeEvent(input$plus,  { count()$setIncrement() })</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  </font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">  output$value &lt;- renderText({ count()$getValue() })</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">}</font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#660066\">shinyApp(ui, server)</font></div></div></code></div><div><br></div><br>In order to be extra obvious about which object methods should call<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> rxTrigger$trigger() </font>and which ones shuold call<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> rxTrigger$depend()</font>, all of the function are prefixed by &quot;<font face=\"courier new, monospace\">set</font>&quot; by they change<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> private$value </font>and by &quot;<font face=\"courier new, monospace\">get</font>&quot; if they<font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"> read</font><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> private$value</font>.<br><br>Let me know if you have questions,</div><div>Barbara</div><div><br>On Sunday, July 30, 2017 at 8:55:36 PM UTC+1, Charlotte S wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Dear shiny users :)<br><br>I am trying to implement an app that use an object as a reactive value. <br>When attributes inside the object are changed, the UI should be notified and redraw. <br>This does not work. It seems that if I make a class object reactive, it does not notice changes on the attributes.<br>Is this true? If so, how can I make the reactive object react to changes in the attributes. In the following I have created a small example that illustrates my issue<br><br>Thanks a lot for your help :)<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">interactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  counter </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> R6Class</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">public</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>         increase </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           </span><span style=\"color:#008\">self</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">self</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>         </span><span style=\"color:#660\">},</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>         decrease </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           </span><span style=\"color:#008\">self</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">self</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>         </span><span style=\"color:#660\">},</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>         getValue </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">self</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>         </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;minus&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;-1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;plus&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;+1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    br</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    textOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;value&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># The comments below show the equivalent logic using reactiveValues()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    c </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactiveVal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>      <br>    c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">counter$new</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$minus</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$decrease</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$plus</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$increase</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    output$value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderText</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$getValue</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>      </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># print(c()$value)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><br><br></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
